1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,457
The Hellscape: a landscape that toys with everyone who enters it.

2
00:00:03,677 --> 00:00:05,427
Here's how the location plays.

3
00:00:06,233 --> 00:00:10,299
Shuffle the four Hellscape tiles and deal one onto each blank space of the board,

4
00:00:10,299 --> 00:00:14,063
with its symbol at the top left so the Panic numbers read the right way up.

5
00:00:14,283 --> 00:00:17,102
Put one Victim on each space of each tile, eight in all.

6
00:00:17,102 --> 00:00:20,576
Then reveal the Setup card for the other Victims, you and the Killer.

7
00:00:20,796 --> 00:00:22,972
Add the Hellshift Action card to the Tableau.

8
00:00:23,800 --> 00:00:26,211
The four double-sided tiles each have a symbol:

9
00:00:26,211 --> 00:00:30,417
star, square, hourglass and clover. They move during the game, and everything on a

10
00:00:30,417 --> 00:00:33,187
tile, you, Enemies, Victims and tokens, moves with it.

11
00:00:33,407 --> 00:00:37,885
Shift: move every tile one step clockwise or anticlockwise, as the card says.

12
00:00:37,885 --> 00:00:39,572
Swap: two tiles trade places.

13
00:00:39,792 --> 00:00:43,833
Flip: take everything off, noting the colour of each space, flip the tile and put

14
00:00:43,833 --> 00:00:46,377
the pieces back on the matching colours. Rearrange:

15
00:00:46,377 --> 00:00:49,371
set all the tiles however you like, but you can't flip them.

16
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,144
Once in every Upkeep you must roll the two Hellscape dice.

17
00:00:53,364 --> 00:00:57,076
If they match, flip that tile. If they're different, swap those two tiles.

18
00:00:57,296 --> 00:01:01,186
In this example both dice show the same symbol, so Ryan flips that tile:

19
00:01:01,186 --> 00:01:05,723
he lifts off himself and three Victims, flips it, and puts the purple pieces back on

20
00:01:05,723 --> 00:01:07,344
purple and the red one on red.

21
00:01:08,167 --> 00:01:11,272
Each tile has one or two wall sides that nobody can cross.

22
00:01:11,272 --> 00:01:15,662
Depending on the layout, a tile or a whole area can be completely cut off from you

23
00:01:15,662 --> 00:01:16,465
or the Enemies.

24
00:01:16,685 --> 00:01:19,352
You'll need to move tiles, or wait for the dice, to get through.

25
00:01:19,572 --> 00:01:24,137
Anyone who panics into a wall, or a direction with no connection, simply stays put.

26
00:01:24,967 --> 00:01:29,145
Range and targeting always count the spaces needed to actually move from one to the

27
00:01:29,145 --> 00:01:29,447
other.

28
00:01:29,667 --> 00:01:33,748
If there's no valid path to a Killer Action's target, the Killer doesn't move, but

29
00:01:33,748 --> 00:01:35,939
still resolves its attacks in its own space.

30
00:01:36,159 --> 00:01:39,069
Closest and farthest only consider reachable Victims.

31
00:01:39,069 --> 00:01:42,858
If none can be reached, ignore the tile walls and use your judgement.

32
00:01:42,858 --> 00:01:45,439
The same goes for things like the nearest exit.

33
00:01:45,659 --> 00:01:49,179
Effects that place someone ignore walls. Effects that move them don't.

34
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:53,115
Hellshift lets you reshape the board. It costs two Time to buy.

35
00:01:53,335 --> 00:01:56,310
Two successes: rearrange all the tiles as you like.

36
00:01:56,310 --> 00:01:59,168
One success: swap any two tiles, and lose a Time.

37
00:01:59,168 --> 00:02:00,801
No successes: lose two Time.

38
00:02:01,021 --> 00:02:05,126
Use it to bring Victims to an exit, or to wall the Killer off from you and everyone

39
00:02:05,126 --> 00:02:05,373
else.

40
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:10,636
Spiral of Death shifts every tile one step anticlockwise, adds a Victim on the star

41
00:02:10,636 --> 00:02:14,750
and square tiles, then the Killer targets you or a Victim, moves and attacks.

42
00:02:14,750 --> 00:02:16,888
Spiral of Horrors shifts them clockwise.

43
00:02:17,108 --> 00:02:20,676
Stare Into The Abyss costs you a health whenever you move onto a tile.

44
00:02:20,676 --> 00:02:24,959
And the Bone Key item lets you ride the Bone Chariot to any tile space for two Time.

45
00:02:25,767 --> 00:02:29,393
A few tips. Use Hellshift to strand the Killer on a tile with no Victims.

46
00:02:29,613 --> 00:02:33,553
Check your route to the exits before shifting, because the Upkeep dice can cut you

47
00:02:33,553 --> 00:02:34,755
off right after a rescue.

48
00:02:34,975 --> 00:02:37,305
It's one of the best-rated boards in the game.

49
00:02:37,305 --> 00:02:37,812
Good luck.

